This weekend was not only my first convention tattooing but also the first convention we did with the @flawlessink_studio crew, my crew, my people… 

For years I’ve been told that i should experience a full convention, my ignorance made me postponed it until I surrendered with the right people that push me to achieve new goals. I was able to connect more with the team and have fun outside the time we share working.

I end this experience, now with me recommending you not to wait, experience your conventions, meet people, make friends, share knowledge. 

Thank you 

